sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Lecturer
    participant CreateExamPage
    participant ExamStatusPage
    participant ExamServiceFE as ExamService
    participant ApiService
    participant Gateway
    participant ExamsController as "exams controller"
    participant ExamsCreate as createExam
    participant ExamsStatus as updateExamStatus
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over Lecturer,DB: API mode with JWT via ApiService

    Lecturer->>CreateExamPage: submit exam form
    CreateExamPage->>ExamServiceFE: createExam(teacherId, examData)
    ExamServiceFE->>ApiService: post /api/exams
    ApiService->>Gateway: POST /api/exams
    Gateway->>ExamsController: proxy /api/exams
    ExamsController->>ExamsCreate: createExam(teacherId, input)
    ExamsCreate->>DB: INSERT exam and questions
    DB-->>ExamsCreate: created rows
    ExamsCreate-->>ExamsController: exam JSON
    ExamsController-->>Gateway: response
    Gateway-->>ApiService: exam JSON
    ApiService-->>ExamServiceFE: exam JSON
    ExamServiceFE-->>CreateExamPage: created exam

    Lecturer->>ExamStatusPage: set status published
    ExamStatusPage->>ExamServiceFE: updateStatus(examId, teacherId, published)
    ExamServiceFE->>ApiService: patch /api/exams/:id/status
    ApiService->>Gateway: PATCH /api/exams/:id/status
    Gateway->>ExamsController: proxy /api/exams
    ExamsController->>ExamsStatus: updateExamStatus(examId, teacherId, nextStatus)
    ExamsStatus->>DB: UPDATE exams.status
    DB-->>ExamsStatus: updated exam
    ExamsStatus-->>ExamsController: exam JSON
    ExamsController-->>Gateway: response
    Gateway-->>ApiService: exam JSON
    ApiService-->>ExamServiceFE: exam JSON
    ExamServiceFE-->>ExamStatusPage: updated exam
